齐性：$\\operatorname{Proj}_{u}(k \\cdot v) = k \\cdot \\operatorname{Proj}_{u}(v)$\n——\"把向量放大 k 倍，影子也放大 k 倍\"\n这两个性质合在一起，定义了一种特殊的操作——线性变换。现在不需要记住这个名词，但请记住：\"投影满足这个规律\"。第4章你会发现：矩阵乘法也满足同样的规律；事实上，投影本身就是一种线性变换。"}]},"status":"reviewed","teaching_profile":{"minimum_level":2,"required_sections":["definition","formula","worked_examples","geometric_meaning"],"requires_analogy_boundary":false},"topic_id":"ch01.projection.properties","visual_semantics":{"entities":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case1_v","kind":"vector","label":"v","role":"vector_a","value":[3,4]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case1_u","kind":"vector","label":"u","role":"direction","value":[1,0]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case1_p","kind":"vector","label":"p","role":"projection","value":[3,0]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case1_H","kind":"point","label":"H","role":"foot","value":[3,0]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case1_r","kind":"vector","label":"r","role":"residual","value":[0,4]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case2_v","kind":"vector","label":"v","role":"vector_a","value":[6,8]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case2_u","kind":"vector","label":"u","role":"direction","value":[1,0]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case2_p","kind":"vector","label":"p","role":"projection","value":[6,0]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case2_H","kind":"point","label":"H","role":"foot","value":[6,0]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"dimension":2,"id":"case2_r","kind":"vector","label":"r","role":"residual","value":[0,8]}],"relations":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch01.projection.properties"],"id":"rel.case.ch01.projection.properties.1","kind":"projects_to","param